1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,406
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,406 --> 00:00:09,335
To approximate a root, split the number into the nearest perfect power plus a small remainder, and factor out the power.

3
00:00:09,335 --> 00:00:11,888
Root one oh two: use a hundred.

4
00:00:11,888 --> 00:00:16,236
Cube root of one twenty seven: use one twenty five.

